settle 8
click .pill Settings
click .side-item Audio and MIDI
click .t-btn Record MIDI diagnostics
click .t-btn Stop MIDI diagnostics
click .t-btn Export MIDI diagnostics…
act midi-checkpoint close-dialog
act diagnostic-request-close
settle 3
act midi-checkpoint close-held
act diagnostic-await close-held
wait 100000
assert snap diagnostic-gate-released == true
act midi-checkpoint should-not-survive-close
